<title>IRAQ: Iraq's oil minister to visit Spain.</title>
<headline>Iraq's oil minister to visit Spain.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi Oil Minister Amir Muhammad Rasheed will fly to Spain at the invitation of the Spanish energy minister to discuss trade between the two countries, the official Iraqi News Agency INA said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;The oil minister's visit to Spain comes upon an official invitation by the Spanish energy minister to discuss...how to activate economic and industrial cooperation,&quot; INA said in a dispatch from Amman where Rasheed is on his way to Madrid.</p>
<p>It did not say when he would start his visit but added Rasheed would also meet Spain's ministers of foreign affairs and foreign trade.</p>
</text>
